{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing for Numbers</strong> is a vibrant, first-person educational adventure where you step into the shoes of an aspiring Mathemagician on a quest to join the prestigious Arcane Anglers Guild. Master increasingly harder equations and catch magical fish to prove your worth and earn your place among the elite!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique way to learn math</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals to extraordinary math dimensions and unleash your fishing spells to summon magical fish. Harvest their essence to fuel your journey, upgrading your spells and empowering rune stones as you master the art of arcane mathematics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/4ce41b8dd982f8538c00a1721c368455.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game mode that fits the way you want to play. Classic Mode offers a preset challenge designed by the development team. Custom Mode lets you adjust the difficulty and rules to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/0cae12f24131b6180234beb258bf5781.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun learning experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a fun and engaging way to learn math, featuring rewarding visuals, a calming atmosphere, and a satisfying sense of progression and achievement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/8f63a19424444ce42330a16d1d407fd0.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290480?t=1758901490","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290480?t=1758901490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/b6e9383defb0e3fc86db5833ce25c0e8e3ca0e88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758901490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/b6e9383defb0e3fc86db5833ce25c0e8e3ca0e88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758901490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3448020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing for Numbers</strong> is a vibrant, first-person educational adventure where you step into the shoes of an aspiring Mathemagician on a quest to join the prestigious Arcane Anglers Guild. Master increasingly harder equations and catch magical fish to prove your worth and earn your place among the elite!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A unique way to learn math</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals to extraordinary math dimensions and unleash your fishing spells to summon magical fish. Harvest their essence to fuel your journey, upgrading your spells and empowering rune stones as you master the art of arcane mathematics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/4ce41b8dd982f8538c00a1721c368455.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a game mode that fits the way you want to play. Classic Mode offers a preset challenge designed by the development team. Custom Mode lets you adjust the difficulty and rules to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/0cae12f24131b6180234beb258bf5781.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun learning experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a fun and engaging way to learn math, featuring rewarding visuals, a calming atmosphere, and a satisfying sense of progression and achievement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/extras/8f63a19424444ce42330a16d1d407fd0.avif?t=1758901490\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["2xP Games AS"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290480/8666091ad493ec26fac5d422429dbe092e93e40c/header.jpg?t=1758901490","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290480/1338448770/e227a1ee120a1e06bdc232300662a9fe65e33556/1758886429/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758887225","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290480/1338448770/e227a1ee120a1e06bdc232300662a9fe65e33556/1758886429/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758887225","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3290480/1338448770/e227a1ee120a1e06bdc232300662a9fe65e33556/1758886429/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758887225","id":257138659,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138659/movie480.mp4?t=1758887225","max":"https://video.akam